>>> GET https://restful-booker.herokuapp.com/ping Request headers: Accept: application/json; Content-Type: application/json Request body: <none> <<< HTTP 201 Response body: Created Given the booking API is available # com.leegality.api.steps.BookingSteps.apiIsAvailable()
>>> POST https://restful-booker.herokuapp.com/auth Request headers: Accept: application/json; Content-Type: application/json Request body: [authentication payload redacted] <<< HTTP 200 Response body: {"token":"[REDACTED]"} When I request an authentication token # com.leegality.api.steps.BookingSteps.requestAuthenticationToken() Then the token response has a non-empty token # com.leegality.api.steps.BookingSteps.tokenIsPresent()

@read @negative @P2 Scenario: Unknown booking ID returns not found # src/test/resources/features/bookings.feature:57
>>> GET https://restful-booker.herokuapp.com/ping Request headers: Accept: application/json; Content-Type: application/json Request body: <none> <<< HTTP 201 Response body: Created Given the booking API is available # com.leegality.api.steps.BookingSteps.apiIsAvailable()
>>> GET https://restful-booker.herokuapp.com/booking/99999999 Request headers: Accept: application/json; Content-Type: application/json Request body: <none> <<< HTTP 404 Response body: Not Found When I read booking 99999999 # com.leegality.api.steps.BookingSteps.readBookingId(int) Then the booking does not exist # com.leegality.api.steps.BookingSteps.bookingDoesNotExist()

